# ---- UART0 offsets and fields ------------------------------------------
# 115200 8N1 at a 125 MHz peripheral clock: IBRD = 125e6/(16*115200) = 67 and
# FBRD = round(0.816*64) = 52. LCR_H enables the FIFOs and an 8-bit word; CR
# enables the UART, the transmitter and the receiver.

